Editor: Julián Rojas, Ghent University - imec http://idlab.ugent.be/, julianandres.rojasmelendez@ugent.be
Abstract: This specification defines an algorithm and the logical processes for a client application to discover a (set of) RDF dataset(s) and/or data service(s) from one or more DCAT-AP data catalogs, based on a given input SHACL shape or SPARQL query.
